:09Z"},{"number":291,"title":"Custom validation checks do not support async implementation","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-05-18T21:41:58Z"},{"number":257,"title":"feat: Claude Code skills for catalog design + multi-surface rendering","comments":2,"created_at":"2026-04-02T09:47:55Z"}],"discussions":[],"latest_release":{"name":"v0.22.0","tag":"v0.22.0","published_at":"2026-11-04T21:47:03Z","body":"\n### New Features\n\n- **Chat SDK renderer:** Added `@json-render/chat` to render specs as Chat SDK cards, so one catalog posts natively on Slack, Teams, and the other Chat SDK platforms. `streamCard` streams a card into a thread and edits it as elements arrive, and `toCard` validates specs against per-component schemas and optional platform limits. State expressions, `visible`, and `repeat` resolve against `spec.state` (#451)\n- **Chat SDK example:** Added a playground that previews generated messages as Slack renders them, with a Teams Adaptive Card view and a copy button for Block Kit Builder (#451)\n\n### Contributors\n\n- @Railly\n\n","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[{"title":"Benchmark Comparison: JSONL vs. TOON output for JSON-render efficiency","url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/json-render/issues/33","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46706853","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-01-21","points":2,"comments":0},{"title":"json-render","url":"https://github.com/vercel-labs/json-render","hn":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46627489","source":"Hacker News","lang":"en","date":"2026-01-15","points":2,"comments":2},{"title":"Vercel 官宣新作：17.7k Stars 的 json-render 冲上 GitHub 日榜前 12，AI 生成 UI 要变天了吗？","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00132/article/details/167393145","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-09"},{"title":"Vercel 开源 json-render 之后：中文前端社区一周讨论观察","url":"https://blog.csdn.net/gitblog_00940/article/details/167395451","source":"blog.csdn","lang":"zh","date":"2026-10-09"},{"title":"Vercel 发布生成式 UI